A glossy yellow icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{file improvement}}` template, for files that someone could redraw or improve. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
